nse is grounded because it accurately reflects the limitations of the provided context. It correctly identifies that while the context establishes a general rule for inhabitants (integer >= 1), it does not contain specific data for the city of Goya. The assistant does not hallucinate a number or introduce unrelated information; it directly addresses the query by explaining that the answer cannot be derived from the text, which is the most accurate response possible given the data.</S1>\n\n<S2>5</S2>"
